5"><span dir="auto" title="Meta AI" class="x1iyjqo2 x6ikm8r x10wlt62 x1n2onr6 xlyipyv xuxw1ft x1rg5ohu x1jchvi3 xjb2p0i xo1l8bm x17mssa0 x1ic7a3i xnpuxes" style="min-height: 0px;">Meta AI</span></div></div></div><div class="xhslqc4 x1c4vz4f x2lah0s x1pg5gke xdzw4kq x193iq5w x1xxsxie x7r5mf7 x6ikm8r x10wlt62 xlyipyv xuxw1ft" data-testid="cell-frame-primary-detail"><span class="x140p0ai x1gufx9m x1s928wv xhkezso x1gmr53x x1cpjm7i x1fgarty x1943h6x x193iq5w xeuugli x13faqbe x1vvkbs x1lliihq x1fj9vlw xhslqc4 x1hx0egp x1pg5gke xjb2p0i xo1l8bm xl2ypbo x1ic7a3i" style="--x-fontSize: 12px; --x-lineHeight: 8.5313px; --x-8dd7yt: -0.0137em; --x-hxtmnb: 0.0137em;">12:22 am</span></div></div><div class="x6s0dn4 x78zum5 x1nxh6w3 x1fc57z9 xr9ek0c xisnujt xhslqc4" data-testid="cell-frame-secondary"><div class="xjbqb8w x1iyjqo2 x1f6kntn x1fc57z9 x6ikm8r x10wlt62 x1yc453h xlyipyv xuxw1ft xo1l8bm"><span class="x78zum5 x1cy8zhl" title="‪Theek hai 💜 Tension mat lo, main pura naya code de deti hun. Tum bas purana sab delete karke ye paste kar dena.

Step 1: Image file ka naam Image ka naam yehi rakhna hai: me.png  
Background already hata hua hai is wali photo ka. Isko download karke me.png naam se save kar lena.

Step 2: Naya pura code - Copy Paste kar do 1. GitHub me index.html pe click karo → Delete this file → Commit changes
2. Fir Add file → Create new file → naam index.html rakho
3. Neeche wala pura code copy karke paste kar do:
&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;
&lt;html lang=&quot;en&quot;&gt;
&lt;head&gt;
&lt;meta charset=&quot;UTF-8&quot;&gt;
&lt;meta name=&quot;viewport&quot; content=&quot;width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0&quot;&gt;
&lt;title&gt;Ankita Biswal - Portfolio&lt;/title&gt;
&lt;style&gt;
    * {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        box-sizing: border-box;
    }
    body {
        font-family: &#39;Poppins&#39;, sans-serif;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f0c29, #302b63, #24243e);
        color: white;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: center;
        min-height: 100vh;
        overflow: hidden;
        text-align: center;
    }
    .container {
        animation: fadeIn 1.5s ease-in;
    }
    @keyframes fadeIn {
        from {opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);}
        to {opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0);}
    }
    .profile-card {
        width: auto;
        height: auto;
        background: transparent;
        box-shadow: none;
        filter: drop-shadow(0 0 25px rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.6)); /* shape me glow */
        margin-bottom: 30px;
        animation: float 3s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    @keyframes float {
        0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0px); }
        50% { transform: translateY(-10px); }
    }
    .profile-img {
        width: 300px;
        height: auto;
        border-radius: 0; /* koi box nahi */
    }
    h1 {
        font-size: 2.5em;
        background: linear-gradient(90deg, #ffd700, #ff8c00);
        -webkit-background-clip: text;
        -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    p {
        font-size: 1.2em;
        color: #ddd;
    }
&lt;/style&gt;
&lt;/head&gt;
&lt;body&gt;
    &lt;div class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;
        &lt;div class=&quot;profile-card&quot;&gt;
            &lt;img src=&quot;me.png&quot; alt=&quot;Ankita Biswal&quot; class=&quot;profile-img&quot;&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;h1&gt;Ankita Biswal&lt;/h1&gt;
        &lt;p&gt;Welcome to my Portfolio ✨&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/body&gt;
&lt;/html&gt;
4. Neeche Commit changes dabao

Step 3: Photo upload karo Add file → Upload files → me.png upload karo → Commit changes

Step 4: Check karo 1-2 min baad https://ankita-biswal-eng.github.io refresh karo

Result: Tumhari photo shape ke hisab se golden glow ke saath floating dikhegi. Koi square/circle box nahi ✨

Ho jaye to screenshot bhejna. Ekdum premium lagega 😍‬" data-testid="last-msg-status"><span dir="auto" class="x1iyjqo2 x6ikm8r x10wlt62 x1n2onr6 xlyipyv xuxw1ft x1rg5ohu xnpuxes" style="min-height: 0px;">Theek hai <img crossorigin="anonymous" alt="💜" draggable="false" class="b71 emoji wa  xnpuxes" tabindex="-1" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" style="background-position: -80px -40px;"> Tension mat lo, main pura naya code de deti hun. Tum bas purana sab delete karke ye paste kar dena.

