<span class="x1noocy9">}</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div><div class="x78zum5 xdt5ytf x3pnbk8"><div class="xwib8y2 xyamay9"><span class="x193iq5w xeuugli x13faqbe x1vvkbs xt0psk2 x1fj9vlw x14ug900 x1hx0egp xngnso2 xjb2p0i xo1l8bm xhacrq1 x1ic7a3i" style="--x-fontSize: 24px; --x-lineHeight: 17.0625px;"><span><strong><span class="xs4xyr0 xqcmdr3 xn0cd8s">Step</span><span class="xs4xyr0 xqcmdr3 xn0cd8s"> 3:</span><span class="xs4xyr0 xqcmdr3 xn0cd8s"> Commit</span><span class="xs4xyr0 xqcmdr3 xn0cd8s"> changes</span></strong></span></span></div><p class="xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak"><span class="x193iq5w xeuugli x1vvkbs xt0psk2 x1fj9vlw x14ug900 x1mzt3pk x1lldw8n x1hx0egp x1f6kntn xjb2p0i x8r4c90 xo1l8bm x1ic7a3i x12xpedu" style="--x-fontSize: 14px; --x-lineHeight: 9.9531px;"><span class="xs4xyr0 xqcmdr3 xn0cd8s">Fir</span><span class="xs4xyr0 xqcmdr3 xn0cd8s"> 1</span><span class="xs4xyr0 xqcmdr3 xn0cd8s"> min</span><span class="xs4xyr0 xqcmdr3 xn0cd8s"> baad</span><span class="xs4xyr0 xqcmdr3 xn0cd8s"> </span></span><span class="x193iq5w xeuugli x1vvkbs xt0psk2 x1fj9vlw x14ug900 x1mzt3pk x1lldw8n x1hx0egp x1f6kntn xjb2p0i x8r4c90 xo1l8bm x1ic7a3i x12xpedu" style="--x-fontSize: 14px; --x-lineHeight: 9.9531px;"><span class="xs4xyr0 xqcmdr3 xn0cd8s"><code class="html-code xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x1lxnp44 xrv4cvt xw2csxc x1odjw0f xmjcpbm">https://ankita-biswal-eng.github.io</code></span></span><span class="x193iq5w xeuugli x1vvkbs xt0psk2 x1fj9vlw x14ug900 x1mzt3pk x1lldw8n x1hx0egp x1f6kntn xjb2p0i x8r4c90 xo1l8bm x1ic7a3i x12xpedu" style="--x-fontSize: 14px; --x-lineHeight: 9.9531px;"><span class="xs4xyr0 xqcmdr3 xn0cd8s"></span><span class="xs4xyr0 xqcmdr3 xn0cd8s"> refresh</span><span class="xs4xyr0 xqcmdr3 xn0cd8s"> karo</span></span></p><p class="xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak"><span class="x193iq5w xeuugli x1vvkbs xt0psk2 x1fj9vlw x14ug900 x1mzt3pk x1lldw8n x1hx0egp x1f6kntn