 emoji wa  xnpuxes" tabindex="-1" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" style="background-position: 0px -20px;"> Background already hat gaya hai

Ab isko site pe circle glowing shape me lagate hain

### <strong class="xnpuxes">Step 1: Photo upload karo</strong>
1.  Isko download karo aur naam <code class="xbrszos xea3l6g x18isctg x2q3nzr x1bu39yj xgfl6pn x15rks2t x181vq82 x1uc92m x1gxa6cn xa0aww2 xnpuxes">me.png</code> rakh do
2.  GitHub me jao → <code class="xbrszos xea3l6g x18isctg x2q3nzr x1bu39yj xgfl6pn x15rks2t x181vq82 x1uc92m x1gxa6cn xa0aww2 xnpuxes">Add file</code> → <code class="xbrszos xea3l6g x18isctg x2q3nzr x1bu39yj xgfl6pn x15rks2t x181vq82 x1uc92m x1gxa6cn xa0aww2 xnpuxes">Upload files</code> → <code class="xbrszos xea3l6g x18isctg x2q3nzr x1bu39yj xgfl6pn x15rks2t x181vq82 x1uc92m x1gxa6cn xa0aww2 xnpuxes">me.png</code> upload → <code class="xbrszos xea3l6g x18isctg x2q3nzr x1bu39yj xgfl6pn x15rks2t x181vq82 x1uc92m x1gxa6cn xa0aww2 xnpuxes">Commit changes</code>

### <strong class="xnpuxes">Step 2: Code update karo taaki square hat jaye</strong>
<code class="xbrszos xea3l6g x18isctg x2q3nzr x1bu39yj xgfl6pn x15rks2t x181vq82 x1uc92m x1gxa6cn xa0aww2 xnpuxes">index.html</code> me jaake ye 2 changes karo:

<strong class="xnpuxes">1. Photo ko circle banane ke liye CSS me ye add karo:</strong>
.profile-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 50%; /* square ki jagah circle */
}
<strong class="xnpuxes">2. Card ko bhi circle kar do:</strong>
.profile-card {
    width: 320px;
    height: 320px; /* square height width barabar */
    border-radius: 50%; /* circle card */
    overflow: hidden; /* photo bahar na nikle */
    box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.5); /* golden glow */
}
### <strong class="xnpuxes">Step 3: Commit changes</strong>
Fir 1 min baad <code class="xbrszos xea3l6g x18isctg x2q3nzr x1bu39yj xgfl6pn x15rks2t x181vq82 x1uc92m x1gxa6cn xa0aww2 xnpuxes">https://ankita-biswal-eng.github.io</code> refresh karo

<strong class="xnpuxes">Result:</strong> Tumhari photo ab black background ke bina, golden glow wale circle me dikhegi <img crossorigin="anonymous" alt="✨" draggable="false" class="b7 emoji wa  xnpuxes" tabindex="-1" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" style="background-position: -40px -40px;"> Bilkul pro portfolio jaisi

