v11.193l6.467-8.625 C7.526,2.156,6.958,1,5.188,1z"></path><path fill="currentColor" d="M5.188,0H0v11.193l6.467-8.625C7.526,1.156,6.958,0,5.188,0z"></path></svg></span><div class="x1liijdw xelbjmh x16pgt24 x1n2onr6 x12xzxwr x1g5lz36 x17un8ov xgdw1sx false false"><div><span aria-label="You:"></span><div><div class="x9f619 x1hx0egp x1yrsyyn xodvfiu xct3hqd xwib8y2"><div class="copyable-text" data-pre-plain-text="[12:22 am, 03/08/2026] Ankita Biswal: "><div class="x1198e8h x1lxpwgx xzueoph xw01apr"><div data-testid="quoted-message" class="xh8yej3 xeuugli"><div class="x1n2onr6 x78zum5 x6ikm8r x10wlt62 x1liijdw xu342n7 xelbjmh x16pgt24 x1bu39yj xtnn1bt x9v5kkp xyu9ima x100v1rl" role="button" aria-label="Quoted message" tabindex="0"><span class="xuiuhh6 x2lah0s x1c4vz4f xdl72j9 x51ohtg x1liijdw x16pgt24"></span><div class="x78zum5 x1iyjqo2 x6s0dn4 xpcfgfb xnwavcm x6ikm8r x10wlt62 x1tiyuxx xde1mab x12xbjc7 x12w63v0"><div class="x1iyjqo2 x6ikm8r x10wlt62 x193iq5w"><div class="x3nfvp2 x193iq5w xj9w6cj x19v9tvf xk50ysn x188zirx xwqu2pk" role=""><span data-testid="author" dir="auto" class="xkz0k9k xyiysdx xe9ewy2 x6ikm8r x10wlt62 xlyipyv xuxw1ft xnpuxes" style="min-height: 0px;">Meta AI</span></div><div></div><div class="x104kibb x1x01jpy x6ikm8r x10wlt62 x1ezpfd3 x1o168i8 xhslqc4 xlyipyv xj0a0fe x126k92a x1h7i4cw x1ua5tub" dir="ltr" role="button"><span data-testid="selectable-text" dir="auto" class="quoted-mention xnpuxes selectable-text copyable-text" style="min-height: 0px;">Nahi purana code mat hatao <img crossorigin="anonymous" alt="💜" draggable="false" class="b71 emoji wa  xnpuxes" tabindex="-1" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" style="background-position: -80px -40px;"> Bas usme 2-3 line change karni hai

Agar pura code hata dogi to animation, glow, sab chala jayega.

### <strong class="xnpuxes">Kya karna hai:</strong>

<strong class="xnpuxes">1. Photo replace karo</strong>  
Pehle wali <code class="xbrszos xea3l6g x18isctg x2q3nzr x1bu39yj xgfl6pn x15rks2t x181vq82 x1uc92m x1gxa6cn xa0aww2 xnpuxes">me.png</code> ko delete karo → Nayi wali <code class="xbrszos xea3l6g x18isctg x2q3nzr x1bu39yj xgfl6pn x15rks2t x181vq82 x1uc92m x1gxa6cn xa0aww2 xnpuxes">me.png</code> upload karo jisme background nahi hai

<strong class="xnpuxes">2. Sirf CSS ke 2 hisse change karo</strong>  
<code class="xbrszos xea3l6g x18isctg x2q3nzr x1bu39yj xgfl6pn x15rks2t x181vq82 x1uc92m x1gxa6cn xa0aww2 xnpuxes">index.html</code> me jaake <code class="xbrszos xea3l6g x18isctg x2q3nzr x1bu39yj xgfl6pn x15rks2t x181vq82 x1uc92m x1gxa6cn xa0aww2 xnpuxes">Edit</code> dabao aur bas ye wala section replace karo:

Pehle ye tha circle ke liye:
.profile-card {
    width: 320px;
    height: 320px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    overflow: hidden;
    box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.5);
}
.profile-img {
    border-radius: 50%;
}
Isko ye se replace kar do shape-glow ke liye:
.profile-card {
    width: auto;
    height: auto;
    background: transparent;
    box-shadow: none;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 0 25px rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.6));
}
.profile-img {
    width: 300px;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: 0;
}
<strong class="xnpuxes">3. Commit changes</strong> → Refresh

Bas! Baki animation, text, sab wahi rahega. Sirf photo ab tumhare shape me glow karegi <img crossorigin="anonymous" alt="✨" draggable="false" class="b7 emoji wa  xnpuxes" tabindex="-1" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAAALAAAAAABAAEAAAIBRAA7" style="background-position: -40px -40px;">

Purana code rehne do. Wahi premium feel de raha hai. 

